{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-08_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-08","title":"ストレス反応","storyCode":"4-8","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"f4bff216bbcdf13a22222e539b9746cb41da4f04ed13e38102936708b2f2a490","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"フロストリーフの案内で、メテオリーテとジェシカを見つけた一行だったが、ジェシカはこの場所での経験により、恐怖に飲まれてしまっていた。\nそこで、アーミヤはある力を使い、ジェシカに寄り添い導いて、彼女を奮い立たせるのだった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"――！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"撃つな、私だ。……そこにいるんだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"援軍を連れてきたぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"メテオリーテさん、私です！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？　待って……まさか、アーミヤ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたが来てくれるなんて……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"すごく嬉しいし、心強いわ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"――だけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたは来るべきじゃなかった。これは向こうの罠なのよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちを助けるためにあなたを危険にさらすのは、リスクが高すぎるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"これは、判断としては間違いよ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、どう見てもお前たちは逃げ切れそうにない状況だった。……この子がそれを知っていて、見捨てるわけがないだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"だから、今更アーミヤを責めても仕方がない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"責めてなんかないわ。ただ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……ううん、やめておきましょう。……ごめんなさい、アーミヤ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"お気になさらず。お二人が無事で、本当に良かったです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……ありがとう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ところで、ジェシカさんの様子が気になるんですが……彼女に何があったんでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うぅ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"それが……ちょっと、ショックで気が動転しちゃってるのよね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"本当は、自力で動けるようになるまで待とうと思ってたんだけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"この様子を見るに、精神的な傷が残ってる可能性もあるだろうし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ジェシカさん、大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"こうなったら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フロストリーフさん、お願いがあります。ジェシカさんの手を私の腕に乗せて、握らせるように押さえておいてもらえませんか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ、大丈夫か！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"はい……！　ただ……これ、は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"深い、悲しみ……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"曖昧では、ありますが……それでも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――ジェシカさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"もう、大丈夫ですから……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"どうか、戻ってきてください……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……アーミヤ、さん……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい、アーミヤです！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……ほんとに……アーミヤさん、だ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"よかった……これで一安心ですね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……ジェシカ、大丈夫……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……わ、私……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"ごめんなさい……あんなの、想像すら……してなくて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"いいえ、気にしないでください……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……私……あんな……う、ぅっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……あなたの感じたこと、私にはわかります。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私も、以前には――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"逃げ出したいのに、足が動かない……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"叫びたいのに、声すら出せない……そんなことがありました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"きっと、あなたも同じような経験をしたんですよね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……それでも、立ってください。ジェシカさん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"怖がらずとも大丈夫です。私たちが、いつでもついていますから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今のあなたは、一人ではありません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一緒にロドスへ帰りましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカさんとリスカムさんも待っていますしね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジェシカ","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"はい……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ……今のは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……どうか、ケルシー先生には内緒にしておいてくださいね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["アーミヤ","フロストリーフ"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["メテオリーテ"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["ジェシカ"]}]}
